# oracle: fix ilves on the dimer lattice of w50il_dimer (64 dimers, tol 1e-4 iter 25) with fix nvt (temp 300 K, Tdamp 100 fs), fix nvt defined BEFORE fix ilves: the first thermostat update after the setup velocity projection; thermo and every per-atom position, velocity and force after 50 steps
# oracle-inputs: w50il_dimer.data
# oracle-compare: thermo=all atoms=all rel=1e-7 abs=1e-9
units           real
atom_style      bond
read_data       w50il_dimer.data
pair_style      lj/cut 8.0
pair_coeff      * * 0.1 2.0
bond_style      harmonic
bond_coeff      1 100.0 1.0
special_bonds   lj 0.0 1.0 1.0
neighbor        2.0 bin
timestep        1.0
fix             1 all nvt temp 300.0 300.0 100.0
fix             cons all ilves 1.0e-4 25 0 b 1
thermo_style    custom step temp pe ebond press
thermo_modify   format float %.15g
thermo          10
run             50
